<given-names>NP</given-names></name><name><surname>Prasad</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Quyyumi</surname><given-names>AA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>N-acetylcysteine improves coronary and peripheral vascular function</article-title><source>J Am Coll Cardiol</source><year>2001</year><volume>37</volume><fpage>117</fpage><lpage>23</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11153725</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Annuk</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Lind</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Linde</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Impaired endothelium-dependent vasodilation in renal failure in humans</article-title><source>Nephrol Dial Transplant</source><year>2001</year><volume>16</volume><fpage>302</fpage><lpage>6</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11158404</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Arbogast</surname><given-names>BW</given-names></name><name><surname>Lee</surname><given-names>GM</given-names></name><name><surname>Raymond</surname><given-names>TL</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>In vitro injury of porcine aortic endothelial cells by very-low-density lipoproteins from diabetic rat serum</article-title><source>Diabetes</source><year>1982</year><volume>31</volume><fpage>593</fpage><lpage>9</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">6819172</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Arcaro</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Cretti</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Balzano</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Insulin causes endothelial dysfunction in humans: 